bodies = PackedStringArray("so we are just not getting paid this week. that is the email. that is the whole email", "a PROCESSING DELAY. {amount} of my money is a processing delay", "got half. HALF. and an apology I did not ask for", "I have {amount} outstanding and a form letter that does not use the word sorry", "everyone check your accounts. right now. tell me what you see", "they have had my money for {weeks} and today they discovered a technical issue", "partial payment received. partial. I did not sign a partial contract", "I put my redundancy money into this", "please can somebody from the office actually answer a phone", "screenshot the email before it gets edited. I have already done it", "this is the second one. the second one. there is no third one", "my sister is in this too and I am the one who put her in it 🙃", "{amount}. that is what is missing. saying it out loud so it exists somewhere", "delayed, apparently. by whom. by what. delayed by whom")
